# Tech sheet — commit ONLY the PDF + self-contained HTML deliverables and the infra
# needed to regenerate them (deploy.py, Adservio-SaqqaraTechSheet/, saqqara-tech-sheet/, evidence/, img/).
# Everything listed below is regenerable or heavy and must stay out of git.

# Heavy / regenerable environments & caches
.venv/
.fontcache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/

# Generated, non-self-contained HTML outputs (rebuild via deploy.py / *.mjs)
Saqqara-Tech-Sheet-Presentation.html
Saqqara-Tech-Sheet-Document.html
Adservio-SaqqaraTechSheet.html

# Generated bundles (zip + old v0 output bundle)
*.zip
Saqqara-Tech-Sheet-bundle_v0/

# Session audit
.cloak-session-audit.jsonl

# Evidence logs are cited by evidence/EVIDENCE.md and listed in evidence/SHA256SUMS: keep them,
# although the repository root ignores *.log.
!evidence/*.log
